## Why This Is Asked
Assesses practical use of CMK, Azure Policy, and Key Vault in a beginner-friendly scenario with rollback.

## Key Concepts
- Customer-managed keys (CMK) in Key Vault
- Azure Policy gating keySource and Key Vault linkage
- Managed identities for service access
- Rollback strategies and key rotation

## Code Example
```json
{
  "policyRule": {
    "if": {
      "allOf": [
        {"equals": [{"field": "type"}, {"value": "Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts"}]},
        {"not": {"field": "Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts/encryption.keySource", "equals": "Microsoft.KeyVault"}}
      ]
    },
    "then": {"effect": "deny"}
  }
}
```

```bash
# Example: apply policy to a scope
az policy set-definition create -d CMKGuardrail --policy-definition CMKPolicy.json
```

